commit 79cc32873a18341a6628198a9781b95978dde991

C03: a level for «lo» with nothing named before it asks what to set (AUDIO1375)

«Ponlo a 100 ahora» and «devuelvelo a 100» name a level for something never mentioned; no reader took them and the model guessed or declined.

__main__._unresolved_input_kind: a put/leave/return/raise/lower verb with the «lo/la» clitic (or «set it», «put it») and a numeric level, with nothing else in the sentence, is the deictic_level input class.
llm.clarify_unresolved_input: for that class the question asks what the person wants set to that level (volume, brightness…) without assuming which, without claiming a failure or misunderstanding.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


